      "surface": "Angular/spectral transport",
      "finding": "Fixed covariant rays are pulled to physical local directions. Isotropic local source weights use initial GL weights times the existing det(scale ratio)/R^3 solid-angle Jacobian and normalize once. Photon stocks already contain angular weight. Nonnegative two-neighbor energy deposition preserves N and U; below-support photons leave through explicit boundary ledgers; above-support input errors rather than clips."
